<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 7,580 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  141   (200 and 193)</p>
<p>    Good		128   (128 and 150)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     118   (117 and 124)</p>
<p>    Medium	    112   (107 and  87)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 95   ( 90 and  74)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 141 pence for a Sri Lanka BOPF.</p>
</text>
